WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.198
"Yesterday was fun," Poppy said.

2
00:00:05.199 --> 00:00:09.531
The friends were at school.

3
00:00:09.531 --> 00:00:19.885
"Yeah," said Eddy.

4
00:00:19.886 --> 00:00:23.563
"Gasser is cool."

5
00:00:23.563 --> 00:00:26.281
Zippy was driving by.

6
00:00:26.282 --> 00:00:30.074
He stopped.

7
00:00:30.075 --> 00:00:33.135
"Who's Gasser?" he asked.

8
00:00:33.135 --> 00:00:37.307
"Gasser is our new friend," Dipper said.

9
00:00:37.308 --> 00:00:41.353
"He's a monster truck."

10
00:00:41.353 --> 00:00:47.216
Zippy laughed.

11
00:00:47.217 --> 00:00:51.264
"Monster trucks look silly," he said.

12
00:00:51.265 --> 00:00:54.464
"Their tires are too big!"

13
00:00:54.465 --> 00:00:59.441
Zippy laughed some more.

14
00:00:59.442 --> 00:01:03.520
A shadow appeared behind him.

15
00:01:03.521 --> 00:01:06.306
He didn't see it.

16
00:01:06.306 --> 00:01:09.918
"Monster trucks are dumb!" Zippy said.

17
00:01:09.918 --> 00:01:12.736
"They're not scary at all!"

18
00:01:12.736 --> 00:01:16.027
The shadow's engine roared.

19
00:01:16.028 --> 00:01:19.297
Brumm, brumm, brumm!

20
00:01:19.298 --> 00:01:22.335
"Ahh!" Zippy screamed.

21
00:01:22.335 --> 00:01:25.029
He zoomed away.

22
00:01:25.029 --> 00:01:29.659
The friends gasped.

23
00:01:29.660 --> 00:01:33.738
"Gasser, it's you!" cried Poppy.

24
00:01:33.739 --> 00:01:38.253
"Surprise!" Gasser said.

25
00:01:38.253 --> 00:01:41.486
"This is my new school!"

26
00:01:41.486 --> 00:01:49.040
Eddy and his friends cheered.

